<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Custom heap memory allocator. </para>



<para>This describes a custom heap memory allocator for GLFW. To set an allocator, pass it to <link linkend="_group__init_1ga0f4c8556a21d9e774a0ba0332da1748e">glfwInitAllocator</link> before initializing the library.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para>init_allocator </para>

<para><link linkend="_group__init_1ga0f4c8556a21d9e774a0ba0332da1748e">glfwInitAllocator</link></para>
</formalpara>
<formalpara><title>Since</title>

<para>Added in version 3.4. </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
